17
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,879
already discussed, functions and

18
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:49,680
systems.

19
00:00:46,879 --> 00:00:51,680
A function is a mathematical concept. It

20
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:54,079
takes an input, processes it according

21
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:55,840
to some rule, and produces an output.

22
00:00:54,079 --> 00:00:58,000
You can think of it in terms of a domain

23
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,840
and a range.

24
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,359
A system is essentially the same idea,

25
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:03,680
but we often use this term in

26
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:05,360
engineering. We talk about inputs and

27
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:07,520
outputs, and the system could be simple

28
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:09,520
or complex.

29
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,920
Now, a network is really just a more

30
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:15,280
complex kind of system, one made up of

31
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:17,280
many interconnected subsystems.

32
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:19,119
The internet is a perfect example.

33
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:21,280
Millions of computers linked together,

34
00:01:19,119 --> 00:01:23,280
exchanging information. From a

35
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:25,439
mathematical perspective, you can think

36
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:28,080
of a network as a very complicated

37
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:31,520
function, often involving many variables

38
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:33,759
and composite functions linked together.

39
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:35,680
In electrical engineering, we often

40
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:38,000
study electrical networks where

41
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:40,159
components like resistors, capacitors,

42
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,240
and inductors are connected to form a

43
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:44,240
circuit. In modern artificial

44
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:46,560
intelligence, we have neural networks

45
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:49,119
which connect many artificial neurons to

46
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:51,360
process information in some ways similar

47
