1217
00:48:50,559 --> 00:48:54,319
Here we see the structure of a

1218
00:48:52,079 --> 00:48:56,800
biological neuron, the basic building

1219
00:48:54,319 --> 00:48:59,119
block of the nervous system.

1220
00:48:56,800 --> 00:49:01,280
A neuron has several main parts. The

1221
00:48:59,119 --> 00:49:03,680
dendrites act like antennas receiving

1222
00:49:01,280 --> 00:49:05,599
incoming signals from other neurons.

1223
00:49:03,680 --> 00:49:07,680
These signals travel toward the cell

1224
00:49:05,599 --> 00:49:10,000
body which contains the nucleus and all

1225
00:49:07,680 --> 00:49:13,040
the essential cellular machinery to keep

1226
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:14,880
the neuron alive and functioning.

1227
00:49:13,040 --> 00:49:17,440
From the cell body, information is sent

1228
00:49:14,880 --> 00:49:19,200
down a long projection called the axon.

1229
00:49:17,440 --> 00:49:21,359
This is essentially the neuron's

1230
00:49:19,200 --> 00:49:23,839
