1231
00:49:21,359 --> 00:49:26,400
signals known as action potentials

1232
00:49:23,839 --> 00:49:28,160
toward the axon terminals. Along the

1233
00:49:26,400 --> 00:49:30,160
way, the signal may be sped up by

1234
00:49:28,160 --> 00:49:32,240
segments of myelin sheath which act as

1235
00:49:30,160 --> 00:49:34,400
insulation.

1236
00:49:32,240 --> 00:49:36,480
