1243
00:49:47,599 --> 00:49:51,200
electrically.

1244
00:49:49,440 --> 00:49:54,000
The important thing to remember is that

1245
00:49:51,200 --> 00:49:56,000
neurons are not just passive wires. They

1246
00:49:54,000 --> 00:49:58,720
integrate inputs, make decisions about

1247
00:49:56,000 --> 00:50:00,800
