1471
00:58:31,839 --> 00:58:35,520
They're excellent for recognizing local

1472
00:58:33,599 --> 00:58:37,200
patterns that repeat across space or

1473
00:58:35,520 --> 00:58:39,119
time.

1474
00:58:37,200 --> 00:58:41,119
