1564
01:02:01,760 --> 01:02:05,760
Once we define a loss function, the

1565
01:02:04,319 --> 01:02:08,000
measure of difference between the

1566
01:02:05,760 --> 01:02:10,079
network's output and the ground truth,

1567
01:02:08,000 --> 01:02:12,240
our goal is to reduce that difference

1568
01:02:10,079 --> 01:02:14,240
step by step.

1569
01:02:12,240 --> 01:02:15,839
We do this by adjusting the network's

1570
01:02:14,240 --> 01:02:18,640
parameters in a way that moves us

1571
01:02:15,839 --> 01:02:20,400
